    </div>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div style="margin-bottom:44px;"><div style="margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0;">Why run Wafer Processing with Hana</h2></div><div class="cap-row-2" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div style="order:1;">
        
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Wafer preparation and assembly within the same OSAT flow</h3>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">Because wafer preparation sits alongside die attach and wire bond, wafers can move directly from thinning and singulation into assembly without an additional supplier handoff.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Wafer preparation and assembly within one group</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">No inter-vendor shipping of fragile wafers</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Continuous material and lot traceability</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Fewer handoffs from wafer to package</span></li></ul>
      </div>
      <div style="order:2;"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:320px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 13px,rgba(18,131,221,0.06) 13px 14px);"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-3);text-align:center;padding:0 18px;line-height:1.5;">[ Wafer prep cell feeding an assembly line ]</span></div></div>
    </div><div class="cap-row-2" style="margin-bottom:36px;">
      <div style="order:2;">
        
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 12px;text-wrap:balance;">Process recipes developed around the device</h3>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">Thinning and singulation conditions are qualified on first articles, allowing the process window to be matched to thin, brittle or otherwise sensitive die before volume production.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;"><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Process recipe qualified on first articles</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Chipping and crack data returned in writing</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">Cleanroom, ESD-controlled handling</span></li><li style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:18px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:baseline;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><span style="color:var(--hana-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;">&rsaquo;</span><span style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.55;">NDA signed before any wafer is shared</span></li></ul>
      </div>
      <div style="order:1;"><div style="position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);width:100%;height:320px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 0 13px,rgba(18,131,221,0.06) 13px 14px);"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink-3);text-align:center;padding:0 18px;line-height:1.5;">[ Engineer reviewing a diced wafer under magnification ]</span></div></div>
    </div></div></div></div>
<div style="background:#fff;"><div class="cap-section"><div data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="dark" data-accent="" data-fade="none" style="margin:0 0 64px;padding:30px 34px;border-radius:var(--radius-panel);background:var(--hana-blue-deep);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="max-width:620px;position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <div style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:10px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin-bottom:10px;">Send us your BOM</div>
